aft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114075","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114075","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114075.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114075.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-04T17:12:19Z"},"body":"Needs to be tested on all platforms where we support Vulkan, but also D3D12 and Metal for SPIR-V.\r\nOur last sync was almost 2 years ago so this is long overdue, and thus would be good to include in 4.6.\r\n\r\nUpdated:\r\n- vulkan headers\r\n- volk\r\n- glslang\r\n- spirv-headers\r\n- spirv-cross\r\n- spirv-reflect\r\n- vk_mem_alloc 3.3.0\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] SPIRV-Reflect not updated yet as they implemented support for specialization constants which conflicts with our patches, so this needs some work to use the new upstream API if suitable.\r\n@DarioSamo Would you be able to take a look at doing the SPIRV-Reflect update as a PR/direct push to my branch?\r\n*Edit:* Done, thanks Darío!\r\n- [x] VulkanMemoryAllocator not updated as it's not versioned together with the SDK, and it often requires more work.\r\nCould be done in a separate PR if that sounds reasonable, or in this PR if we risk having issues by sticking to an older version.\r\n*Edit:* Done, we can remove it if it causes issues.\r\n- [x] Update MoltenVK for official builds. WIP in https://github.com/godotengine/moltenvk-osxcross/pull/5.\r\n*Edit:* Done with https://github.com/godotengine/godot-build-scripts/pull/143.\r\n\r\nSupersedes #107773.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repi